  "Question": "A geometric sequence has \\(a_1=1\\) and \\(q=2\\). What is the sum of its first 5 terms?",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "31",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(S_5=1\\times(32-1)/1=31\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Generate and add the terms\n\nSince each term is twice the previous one, the first five terms are \\(1,2,4,8,16\\). Their sum is\n\\[\n1+2+4+8+16=31.\n\\]",
